{"openapi": "3.1.0", "info": {"title": "Agile Metrics Forecast API", "version": "0.1.0"}, "paths": {"/api/forecast": {"post": {"summary": "Post Forecast", "operationId": "post_forecast_api_forecast_post", "requestBody": {"content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ForecastRequestBody"}}}, "required": true}, "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ForecastResponseBody"}}}}, "400": {"description": "Invalid input", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponseBody"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}}, "components": {"schemas": {"ErrorResponseBody": {"properties": {"error": {"type": "string", "title": "Error"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["error"], "title": "ErrorResponseBody", "description": "The JSON body returned on any validation failure."}, "ForecastRequestBody": {"properties": {"history": {"anyOf": [{"items": {"type": "integer"}, "type": "array"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "History"}, "period_days": {"type": "integer", "title": "Period Days"}, "backlog_size": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Backlog Size"}, "target_date": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string", "format": "date"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Target Date"}, "seed": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Seed"}, "linear_api_key": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Linear Api Key"}, "linear_team_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Linear Team Id"}, "linear_periods": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Linear Periods"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["period_days"], "title": "ForecastRequestBody", "description": "The JSON body `POST /api/forecast` accepts (contracts/forecast-api.md).\n\n`history` is optional - exactly one of it, or both `linear_api_key` and\n`linear_team_id`, is required (spec 006; enforced in `_compute_forecast`,\nmatching the existing `backlog_size`/`target_date` \"exactly one of\"\npattern rather than a separate pydantic validator)."}, "ForecastResponseBody": {"properties": {"outcomes": {"additionalProperties": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string", "format": "date"}, {"type": "integer"}]}, "type": "object", "title": "Outcomes"}, "trials_run": {"type": "integer", "title": "Trials Run"}, "periods_used": {"type": "integer", "title": "Periods Used"}, "reference_date": {"type": "string", "format": "date", "title": "Reference Date"}, "distribution": {"items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/OutcomeBucket"}, "type": "array", "title": "Distribution"}, "projection": {"items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProjectionPoint"}, "type": "array", "title": "Projection"}, "history": {"items": {"type": "integer"}, "type": "array", "title": "History"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["outcomes", "trials_run", "periods_used", "reference_date", "distribution", "projection", "history"], "title": "ForecastResponseBody", "description": "`ForecastResult`'s fields plus the actual per-period history used -\nwhether typed in manually or fetched from Linear - so presentation\nlayers (the web UI's charts, spec 005) can draw the burn-up/run charts\nwithout already knowing the counts client-side. Linear mode never gives\nthe frontend the raw counts the way manual paste does (spec 006), so\nthey're echoed back here instead. No change to `ForecastResult` itself\n(Constitution Principle II) - this is a web-layer-only addition."}, "HTTPValidationError": {"properties": {"detail": {"items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"}, "type": "array", "title": "Detail"}}, "type": "object", "title": "HTTPValidationError"}, "OutcomeBucket": {"properties": {"lower": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string", "format": "date"}, {"type": "integer"}], "title": "Lower"}, "upper": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string", "format": "date"}, {"type": "integer"}], "title": "Upper"}, "trials": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0.0, "title": "Trials"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["lower", "upper", "trials"], "title": "OutcomeBucket", "description": "One bar of the outcome distribution (spec 005 data-model.md)."}, "ProjectionPoint": {"properties": {"period": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1.0, "title": "Period"}, "period_end": {"type": "string", "format": "date", "title": "Period End"}, "cumulative": {"additionalProperties": {"type": "integer"}, "type": "object", "title": "Cumulative"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["period", "period_end", "cumulative"], "title": "ProjectionPoint", "description": "One future period of the burn-up fan (spec 005 data-model.md)."}, "ValidationError": {"properties": {"loc": {"items": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "integer"}]}, "type": "array", "title": "Location"}, "msg": {"type": "string", "title": "Message"}, "type": {"type": "string", "title": "Error Type"}, "input": {"title": "Input"}, "ctx": {"type": "object", "title": "Context"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["loc", "msg", "type"], "title": "ValidationError"}}}}
